  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "88e5f65c-6c6b-4e83-a41e-9ccd736b8f4c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# The most commonly used Matplotlib (matplotlib.pyplot) commands for Data Analysts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7ade531d-da00-4a20-9855-4b503dd54395",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "| Command                           | Purpose                       |\n",
    "| --------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n",
    "| `import matplotlib.pyplot as plt` | Import Matplotlib             |\n",
    "| `plt.plot(x, y)`                  | Create a line chart           |\n",
    "| `plt.scatter(x, y)`               | Create a scatter plot         |\n",
    "| `plt.bar(x, y)`                   | Create a vertical bar chart   |\n",
    "| `plt.barh(x, y)`                  | Create a horizontal bar chart |\n",
    "| `plt.hist(data)`                  | Create a histogram            |\n",
    "| `plt.boxplot(data)`               | Create a box plot             |\n",
    "| `plt.pie(data)`                   | Create a pie chart            |\n",
    "| `plt.figure(figsize=(8,5))`       | Set figure size               |\n",
    "| `plt.title(\"Title\")`              | Add chart title               |\n",
    "| `plt.xlabel(\"X-axis\")`            | Add X-axis label              |\n",
    "| `plt.ylabel(\"Y-axis\")`            | Add Y-axis label              |\n",
    "| `plt.legend()`                    | Display legend                |\n",
    "| `plt.grid(True)`                  | Show grid lines               |\n",
    "| `plt.xlim(0,10)`                  | Set X-axis limits             |\n",
    "| `plt.ylim(0,100)`                 | Set Y-axis limits             |\n",
    "| `plt.xticks()`                    | Customize X-axis ticks        |\n",
    "| `plt.yticks()`                    | Customize Y-axis ticks        |\n",
    "| `plt.style.use(\"ggplot\")`         | Apply chart style             |\n",
    "| `plt.show()`                      | Display the chart             |\n",
    "| `plt.savefig(\"chart.png\")`        | Save chart as an image        |\n",
    "| `plt.clf()`                       | Clear current figure          |\n",
    "| `plt.close()`                     | Close the current figure      |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "131dc166-5d7a-499f-a7c3-3d243b384a7e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Multiple Plots"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f6e11e26-56ae-4b6c-bb63-5904e80ac34c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "| Command              | Purpose                |\n",
    "| -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n",
    "| `plt.subplot(2,2,1)` | Create subplots        |\n",
    "| `plt.subplots()`     | Create figure and axes |\n",
    "| `plt.tight_layout()` | Adjust subplot spacing |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c2f7196b-5bc1-448b-aaba-b9f06a1fe5a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Line Formatting"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4405848f-3f75-42b3-a2c8-e5ed09801e1e",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "| Command          | Purpose            |\n",
    "| ---------------- | ------------------ |\n",
    "| `color=\"red\"`    | Change line color  |\n",
    "| `linestyle=\"--\"` | Dashed line        |\n",
    "| `linewidth=2`    | Change line width  |\n",
    "| `marker=\"o\"`     | Add markers        |\n",
    "| `markersize=8`   | Change marker size |\n",
    "| `alpha=0.5`      | Set transparency   |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aeea083b-7756-4614-b2dd-a07494a2bbff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Common Colors"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "910e7e41-6e15-4d7f-8e23-cc32828a25dd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "• \"red\"\n",
    "• \"blue\"\n",
    "• \"green\"\n",
    "• \"black\"\n",
    "• \"orange\"\n",
    "• \"purple\"\n",
    "• \"yellow\"\n",
    "• \"cyan\"\n",
    "• \"magenta\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ce6dcfed-589d-40d0-ad3e-c060e6ccc1bd",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Common Marker Styles"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "41e9a7d9-2233-4126-8434-f68cadace162",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "| Marker | Meaning  |\n",
    "| ------ | -------- |\n",
    "| `\"o\"`  | Circle   |\n",
    "| `\"s\"`  | Square   |\n",
    "| `\"^\"`  | Triangle |\n",
    "| `\"*\"`  | Star     |\n",
    "| `\"+\"`  | Plus     |\n",
    "| `\"x\"`  | Cross    |\n",
    "| `\"D\"`  | Diamond  |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "92cb249e-2186-4196-8450-28e9796557ea",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Important Parameters"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "33ebfc4b-8e40-4af5-b686-b1519cd0c44d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "| Command             | Purpose                                                                    |\n",
    "| ------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n",
    "| `vert=False`        | Horizontal box plot                                                        |\n",
    "| `showmeans=True`    | Display the mean                                                           |\n",
    "| `showfliers=False`  | Hide outliers                                                              |\n",
    "| `patch_artist=True` | Fill the box with color                                                    |\n",
    "| `labels=[...]`      | Add labels to each box (older versions; `tick_labels` in newer Matplotlib) |\n",
    "| `widths=0.5`        | Change box width                                                           |\n",
    "| `boxprops={}`       | Customize the box                                                          |\n",
    "| `medianprops={}`    | Customize the median line                                                  |\n",
    "| `whiskerprops={}`   | Customize the whiskers                                                     |\n",
    "| `capprops={}`       | Customize the whisker caps                                                 |\n",
    "| `flierprops={}`     | Customize outlier markers                                                  |\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9f4d0f4f-1e02-404e-b71c-c726a0c9e965",
